  "  ""I-184"": ""the author, 2026-10-13: \""the closures are the difference between reading and writing an index\""; and, of the tags 100BRIAN and 011BRIAN (in _archive/_chat_history/Describing the Atlas.md): \""one is my read tag, the other is my write tag\""; and \""arithmetic is the read, boolean is the write\"""","
